r_msg: str) -> None:',\n        content\n    )\n    \n    # 8. Add return type to success_rate property\n    content = re.sub(\n        r'(@property\\s+def success_rate\\(self\\):)',\n        r'@property\\n    def success_rate(self) -> float:',\n        content\n    )\n\n    with open(file_path, 'w') as f:\n        f.write(content)\n\n# Apply fixes to all Python files in src/\nsrc_dir = Path('src')\nif src_dir.exists():\n    for py_file in src_dir.glob('*.py'):\n        add_type_annotations(py_file)\n        print(f\"Fixed {py_file}\")\n\nprint(\"Applied basic type fixes\")\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/fix_types.py"}
